--- Addendum: corrections to the first transcript pass ---
* Step 4 (fixation) initially showed a server-generated sid because the first
  demo build ignored planted ids absent from its session table. Demo corrected
  (vulnerable build now honors any client-supplied sid); re-run 2026-10-09:
  post-login sid = PLANTED-BY-ATTACKER, and a second client presenting that id
  receives "dashboard for alice" — the full fixation chain, proven.
* Step 6 rate-limit: the first pass tripped 429 early because successful logins
  also counted toward the window. Re-run on a fresh fixed server: 5x 401,
  then 429 with `Retry-After: 60` — matching the lesson text.
* Cookie flags verified from the Set-Cookie response header (fixed build):
  `Set-Cookie: sid=<32 hex>; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax; Path=/`.
* Cleanup note: one `kill $SRV` raced the background start and missed; the
  server was killed by explicit PID afterwards. Verified: no auth-demo
  processes remain, nothing listening on 18095/18096/18097.
